  m_Name: RiverShipyard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: RiverShipyard
  displayName: Shipyard
  description: A galleon rising in its frame of props, a sheer-legs crane and stacks
    of oak. Trains Galleons with broadsides of cannon; its ferry seats 8. Build it
    on the shore of open water. Its boats patrol the water and shoot at raiders near
    the shore; send troops to land the water cuts off and its ferry carries them
    across.
